- recipe.threads 48 -> 96, recipe.cpu_shape NUMA_FULL_T48 -> NUMA_FULL.

Unsigned. Part of the DAR-LAT-3h stack-change package
(epyc-root, operator artifact dir stack-change-dar-lat-3h-20260926).

